/E (In this section, the robot is required to store the Harmonic Fragments, which are represented by the balls collected during Task 3. Unlike previous tasks, the robot cannot physically reach the storage boxes. Instead, the robot must transport the collected fragments to a designated throwing position located at the center of the circle. From this position, the robot must identify the storage boxes and accurately throw each fragment into the corresponding box\(color of the box will be gray in color\). Successful completion of this task requires the robot to correctly recognize the target boxes and ensure that all collected fragments are deposited inside them.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
